  "description": "Three complete pairs of line segments on identical1cm scales preserving mixed-unit conversion and the shorter-by relationship.",
  "source": {
    "authoredBasis": "The original seed supplies no image. New paired constructions use the same35-user-unit centimeter and a20-cell scale. A constructs8/4cm from subtraction during conversion; B constructs12/16cm by reversing shorter to longer; C constructs12/8cm. Each pair keeps complete endpoints and scale projections,not a scalar answer alone. Recognition does not prove autonomous drawing.",
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "math3-multidigit",
        "exercise": "85",
        "text": "85. 画出一条长1分米2厘米的线段，再画一条比它短4厘米的线段。"
      },
      {
        "lesson": "math3-multidigit",
        "exercise": "85-authored-complete-pair",
        "text": "先画长 1 分米 2 厘米的线段 $PQ$，再画比它短 4 厘米的线段 $RS$。各图刻度相同，每小格横向表示 1 厘米。哪份完整的两线段构造及长度记录正确？"
      }
    ],
